"Ship system providing beam weapon configuration. Beam frequency affects "
"damage against shields.\n"
"\n"
"Each beam weapon has a mount that defines its firing arc, the direction the "
"arc points in, and its range, damage, and cycle time. It also optionally "
"supports functioning as a rotating turret with a defined speed in tracking "
